# Templates CI conventions

## Stages (GitLab)

`validate` → `test` → `security` → `build` → `deploy` → `post-deploy`

## Job files

- One control per file: `secret-scan.yml`, `sast.yml`, etc.
- GitLab: `include: local:` paths; document copy to `.gitlab/jobs/`
- GitHub: reusable `workflow_call` in `workflows/jobs/`

## Gates

- Upload SARIF where supported
- Run `python scripts/gate-check.py --control <name> --report <file>` after scan
- Read mode from `config/security-gate-policy.yaml` (`mode: warn|block`)
- Do not use blind `continue-on-error: true` — gate script decides

## Variables

- `REGISTRY` / `SECURITY_POLICY` in entrypoint
- `ENABLE_REAL_LINTERS=true` for opt-in real linters (A2)

## Mirror rule

Every GitLab job change needs matching GitHub workflow job with same severity contract.
